Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}This is the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}ここが大事なんだけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.94,0:00:03.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You could say all this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.94,0:00:03.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}いろいろ言うのはいい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.08,0:00:05.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You could say Tuskegee and people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.08,0:00:05.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}don't even know what that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.08,0:00:05.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}でも「Tuskegee」って言っても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.08,0:00:05.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}みんな知らないんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:07.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Right. Hold on. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:07.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}そうだな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:07.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}待て待て
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.45,0:00:08.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}No, I know. Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.45,0:00:08.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}いや、わかってる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.45,0:00:08.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}待って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.07,0:00:12.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And they just think you're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.07,0:00:12.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}throwing things out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.07,0:00:12.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}みんな「適当に言ってる」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.49,0:00:15.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and they're like, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.49,0:00:15.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}he's just saying things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.49,0:00:15.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}「口から出まかせだ」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.49,0:00:15.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}思っちゃうんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.29,0:00:19.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But if people do the research,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.29,0:00:19.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}if you can articulate what Tuskegee...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.29,0:00:19.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}でもみんなが調べたら　Tuskegeeで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.29,0:00:19.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}実際に何があったか説明できたら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:24.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}what really happened, which
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:24.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}is legit, it really happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:24.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}あれは本当にあったことだから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:28.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}it's not a conspiracy theory. The
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:28.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}government did this to people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:28.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}陰謀論じゃない　政府が実際に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:28.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}やったことなんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:33.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Then you can get people on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:33.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}the side of what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:33.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}そうすれば
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:33.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}みんな味方してくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:40.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}It all becomes about articulation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:40.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}and history, because history is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:40.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}大事なのは伝え方と歴史
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:40.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}歴史は事実だからな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.93,0:00:45.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And that's what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.93,0:00:45.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Sometimes I think we as Americans,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.93,0:00:45.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺はそう思う
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.93,0:00:45.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}アメリカ人には
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.95,0:00:47.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}we have no history anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.95,0:00:47.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}もう歴史がないんじゃないかって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.45,0:00:50.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}We're not learning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.45,0:00:50.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}history, real history.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.45,0:00:50.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}歴史を学んでない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.45,0:00:50.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}本当の歴史をな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.43,0:00:53.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Teaching history,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.43,0:00:53.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}it's all done, it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.43,0:00:53.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}歴史の授業なんて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.43,0:00:53.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}もう消えちまった
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.33,0:00:58.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And we need to bring that back,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.33,0:00:58.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}and bring it back in the right way,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.33,0:00:58.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}それを取り戻さなきゃ　正しいやり方でな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.33,0:00:58.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}何が本当にあったか
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.83,0:01:01.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}where people articulate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.83,0:01:01.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}what really happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.83,0:01:01.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ちゃんと伝えられるように
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.05,0:01:03.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}What you guys are doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.05,0:01:03.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}what's different right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.05,0:01:03.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}お前らがやってることは
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.05,0:01:03.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ここが違うんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.86,0:01:07.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}because as you're talking,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.86,0:01:07.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}I felt, I was like, wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.86,0:01:07.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}話を聞いてて思った
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.50,0:01:09.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}there wouldn't have been
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.50,0:01:09.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}no way for me to become
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.50,0:01:09.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}「Drink Champsに来なかったら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.61,0:01:12.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}president without
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.61,0:01:12.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}coming to Drink Champs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.61,0:01:12.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}大統領にはなれなかった」って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.19,0:01:15.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}When you were talking
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.19,0:01:15.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}right now, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.19,0:01:15.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}今の話を聞いてて…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.18,0:01:23.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}you know, what you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.18,0:01:23.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}the way you articulated it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.18,0:01:23.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}その伝え方だよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.18,0:01:23.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺たちがずっと
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.35,0:01:26.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}because it's very important that we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.35,0:01:26.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}stay in constant communication.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.35,0:01:26.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}話し合い続けることが
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.35,0:01:26.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}すごく大事なんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.94,0:01:30.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}That's what the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.94,0:01:30.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}enemy wants us to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.94,0:01:30.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}敵の狙いはそこなんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.51,0:01:32.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}They don't want us to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.51,0:01:32.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Like the slave ships, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.51,0:01:32.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺たちに話させたくない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.51,0:01:32.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}奴隷船と同じだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.33,0:01:34.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}They cut our tongues and told
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.33,0:01:34.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}us not to talk to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.33,0:01:34.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}舌を切って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.33,0:01:34.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}互いに話すなって言った
